WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.097
Jinying told the guards that Mandy was only trying to save the monkey.

2
00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:16.539
The monkey was still in Mandy's arms.

3
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.803
"We will be on our way," Jinying said gently.

4
00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:24.805
She followed Jinying as he walked away.

5
00:00:24.806 --> 00:00:29.410
"What will happen to him?" Mandy asked.

6
00:00:29.411 --> 00:00:33.534
She looked back at the guards and the monkey owner.

7
00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:38.272
"Nothing. I explained his cruelty," replied Jinying.

8
00:00:38.273 --> 00:00:41.816
"The guards agreed he should give up the animal."

9
00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:46.079
"Thank you so much," Mandy said.

10
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.009
The monkey looked happy.

11
00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:53.869
"I know a place where this monkey will be safe," said Jinying.

12
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.808
"The Giant Wild Goose Pagoda."

13
00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:01.967
Mandy didn't know Vinnie was going to the same place.

14
00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:06.802
Teacher Hu told his student, Sheng, to take Vinnie there.

15
00:01:06.803 --> 00:01:12.808
"Why is this pagoda called the Giant Wild Goose?" asked Vinnie.

16
00:01:12.809 --> 00:01:18.483
"There were some monks who lived in that temple," began Sheng.

17
00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:21.274
"They had no meat to eat.

18
00:01:21.275 --> 00:01:26.485
They wanted meat so badly that they prayed every day to Buddha.

19
00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:31.281
Finally, one day, a group of geese flew above them.

20
00:01:31.282 --> 00:01:36.345
Suddenly, the biggest goose got tired and fell to earth.

21
00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:39.482
The monks believed Buddha was angry.

22
00:01:39.483 --> 00:01:44.220
Because of their greed for meat, an innocent animal died.

23
00:01:44.221 --> 00:01:47.950
So they decided never to eat meat again."

24
00:01:47.951 --> 00:01:50.868
"Wow," said Vinnie.

25
00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:53.680
They arrived at the pagoda.

26
00:01:53.681 --> 00:01:58.533
Vinnie counted five stories, just like in the photo.

27
00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.672
Then he heard a familiar voice.

28
00:02:01.673 --> 00:02:06.269
"Vinnie!" Mandy ran over to her brother.

29
00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.072
"What is that?"

30
00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:11.541
Vinnie pointed to the monkey on her shoulder.

31
00:02:11.542 --> 00:02:15.204
"Isn't he cute?" asked Mandy.

32
00:02:15.205 --> 00:02:17.472
Vinnie rolled his eyes.

33
00:02:17.473 --> 00:02:23.221
"Mandy," he said, "I think this is the right building."

34
00:02:23.222 --> 00:02:29.630
He took out the photo, and it was glowing blue.

35
00:02:29.631 --> 00:02:35.221
"But we're not standing in the right place," said Mandy.

36
00:02:35.222 --> 00:02:38.498
Jinying and Sheng were talking.

37
00:02:38.499 --> 00:02:44.230
"Who is that?" Vinnie and Mandy asked at the same time.

38
00:02:44.231 --> 00:02:49.743
They looked at each other and laughed.

39
00:02:49.744 --> 00:02:54.003
"Mandy?" Jinying walked over to her.

40
00:02:54.004 --> 00:02:57.295
"Sheng says the monkey will be safe here."

41
00:02:57.296 --> 00:03:04.667
"Good-bye, little friend," said Mandy, sadly.

42
00:03:04.668 --> 00:03:08.870
"I must return home now," Jinying said.

43
00:03:08.871 --> 00:03:13.956
"But before I leave, I will stop to touch the stone lions for luck."

44
00:03:13.957 --> 00:03:17.271
"Lions?" asked Mandy.

45
00:03:17.272 --> 00:03:22.273
"Long ago, nearby kings wanted permission to trade on the Silk Road.

46
00:03:22.274 --> 00:03:25.861
So they gave lions to our emperor as gifts.

47
00:03:25.862 --> 00:03:31.209
Our people had never seen lions before," explained Jinying.

48
00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.416
"Now we put two stone lions in front of important buildings.

49
00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:39.481
They protect the building and bring good luck and happiness."

50
00:03:39.482 --> 00:03:42.015
The children followed Jinying.

51
00:03:42.016 --> 00:03:47.066
"The picture is glowing brighter," Vinnie said excitedly.

52
00:03:47.067 --> 00:03:53.135
Jinying led them to the statues in front of the Giant Wild Goose Pagoda.

53
00:03:53.136 --> 00:03:58.756
One of the lions was a male, and the other was a female.

54
00:03:58.757 --> 00:04:02.806
They both were guarding the entrance to the pagoda.

55
00:04:02.807 --> 00:04:06.615
The picture glowed red.

56
00:04:06.616 --> 00:04:10.603
"Thank you, Jinying," Mandy called out.

57
00:04:10.604 --> 00:04:16.557
The children fell down the dark tunnel.

58
00:04:16.558 --> 00:04:23.818
Vinnie and Mandy opened their eyes, and two pairs of eyes stared back at them.

59
00:04:23.819 --> 00:04:28.679
The twins dropped their ice cream and began screaming.

60
00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.480
"Oh no!" gasped Mandy.

61
00:04:32.481 --> 00:04:39.118
"I think they saw us!"
